    "detailed_description": "Ever dreamed of making delicious beverages in a cafe setting for minimum wage?<br><br>Working long and stressful hours for little to no pay, while still expected to be perky and chipper?<br><br><strong>Now you can!</strong> Except you won't be doing it for minimum wage.. <strong>you'll be doing it for the price of a cup of coffee!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207500/extras/26c1af0c464c7fd57b370897ea4958a3.poster.avif?t=1582062358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207500/extras/26c1af0c464c7fd57b370897ea4958a3.webm?t=1582062358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207500/extras/26c1af0c464c7fd57b370897ea4958a3.mp4?t=1582062358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enter the fast-paced world of cafe life:<br><br>- Craft delicious beverages for impatient people at a hectic pace!<br>- Decorate your cafe and make the hippest and trendiest place in the city!<br>- Restock and supply your cafe, and manage your cafe's recipes and operations!<br>- Work hard for and upgrade your cafe, reorganizing and purchasing new equipment, and unlocking new and exciting recipes!<br><br><strong>So what are you waiting for? Let's make some coffee.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "Ever dreamed of making delicious beverages in a cafe setting for minimum wage?<br><br>Working long and stressful hours for little to no pay, while still expected to be perky and chipper?<br><br><strong>Now you can!</strong> Except you won't be doing it for minimum wage.. <strong>you'll be doing it for the price of a cup of coffee!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207500/extras/26c1af0c464c7fd57b370897ea4958a3.poster.avif?t=1582062358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207500/extras/26c1af0c464c7fd57b370897ea4958a3.webm?t=1582062358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207500/extras/26c1af0c464c7fd57b370897ea4958a3.mp4?t=1582062358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enter the fast-paced world of cafe life:<br><br>- Craft delicious beverages for impatient people at a hectic pace!<br>- Decorate your cafe and make the hippest and trendiest place in the city!<br>- Restock and supply your cafe, and manage your cafe's recipes and operations!<br>- Work hard for and upgrade your cafe, reorganizing and purchasing new equipment, and unlocking new and exciting recipes!<br><br><strong>So what are you waiting for? Let's make some coffee.</strong>",
    "short_description": "Cafe management and crafting sim where you live the hectic life of a Barista. Play alone or with friends for the price of a latte!",
